---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Unitscalers | Specialist Skincare & Wellness Marketing Agency"
  description="Unitscalers is a specialist marketing agency built exclusively for D2C skincare brands and local skincare businesses. Here's why we only work in this category."
>
  <section class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-32 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 leading-tight text-brand-dark dark:text-white">
        Why Unitscalers Only Works With Skincare & Wellness Businesses
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base md:text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
        Unitscalers started with a simple observation: skincare and wellness brands get treated like every other ecommerce category by most marketing agencies — and that's exactly why so many of them plateau.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-none text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
        <p class="mb-8 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Buyers in this category don't behave like buyers anywhere else. They research ingredients. They demand proof. They stay loyal to routines, not one-off purchases. A generalist agency running the same playbook across ten industries misses that every time.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-dark dark:text-white mt-12 md:mt-16 mb-6">A Specialist Beats a Generalist</h2>
        <p class="mb-8 border-l-4 border-brand-dark dark:border-brand-green pl-6 italic text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
          We made a deliberate choice: work only with skincare and wellness brands — both online-first D2C brands and local clinics, stores, and spas — instead of splitting attention across unrelated industries. That focus is the whole differentiator.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-dark dark:text-white mt-12 md:mt-16 mb-6">Real Experience, Honestly Labeled</h2>
        <p class="mb-8 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Before narrowing into skincare, our founder delivered real client work including a full SEO audit and native German website copy for <strong class="text-brand-dark dark:text-white">Taco Loco Berlin</strong>, an SEO strategy and AI-generated content pipeline for <strong class="text-brand-dark dark:text-white">Tocoloco</strong>, and brand documentation and design systems for <strong class="text-brand-dark dark:text-white">Burrito Madre</strong>'s multi-location rollout.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-8 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          None of that work was skincare-specific — we say so plainly, because proof of method matters more than pretending otherwise.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-dark dark:text-white mt-12 md:mt-16 mb-6">How We Work</h2>
        <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wide bg-white dark:bg-black text-brand-dark dark:text-gray-200 p-5 sm:p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 uppercase">
          Audit first. Strategy second. Execution and reporting after that.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-12 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Full transparency on what's working and what isn't. No inflated case studies, no invented testimonials, no fabricated numbers. If we don't have proof yet, we say so.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-12 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 pt-12">
        <Button href="/digital-brands" variant="outline">Meet our services for D2C brands</Button>
        <Button href="/local-brands" variant="outline">Meet our services for local businesses</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
